# Xsolla AI Kit (Cursor)

This repository is an **agent skills toolkit** for Xsolla integrations (merchant setup, catalog, Login, Headless Checkout, webhooks, full shop orchestration).

## Where to look

- **Skills (source of truth for Cursor):** `.cursor/skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`
- **Deep how-to:** `.cursor/skills/<skill-name>/references/` — read only what the current phase needs
- **Canonical tree (same content):** `skills/` (used by other agents / plugins)

Do **not** invent Xsolla integration steps from memory. Open the matching skill, then load the referenced files for that phase.

## Entry point

For an end-to-end shop, start with `shop-setup`. It scopes the work and chains the domain skills.
